    <title>Winter Bird Census</title>
      <pubDate>
      2022-02-04
      </pubDate>
    <language>FINNISH</language>
    <abstract>
        <para>Censuses cover all observed bird species. Annual counts have been done in the winter time since 1957. Methodology is explained in link: 
http://www.luomus.fi/seurannat/methods.htm
Data_quality: From year 2019, 390 documents are incorrectly missing MY.taxonCensus: aves -key/value, which tell that all observed birds have been recorded during the census.</para>
    </abstract>
